                                    <h1>Salon &amp; Spa Management Software Development Guide 2026</h1>
                                    <p>Salon + spa is one of the most software-underserved service categories despite being $150B+ globally. Small independents run on WhatsApp + Excel; chains run on legacy systems. Here is what a modern salon / spa management platform actually needs and what off-shelf vs custom decisions look like.</p>
                                    <h2>Core Feature Set</h2>
                                    <ul><li>Appointment booking (online + in-app + walk-in)</li><li>Staff schedule + availability</li><li>Service catalog + pricing</li><li>POS + payments</li><li>Staff commission calculation</li><li>Inventory (products + treatments)</li><li>Customer profile + service history</li><li>Loyalty + membership + package tracking</li><li>Marketing (SMS / WhatsApp / email reminders)</li><li>Reports + analytics</li></ul>
                                    <h2>Off-Shelf Options</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Fresha:</strong> global, freemium POS + payment take rate. Popular USA/UK.<br><strong>Zenoti:</strong> chain / enterprise, comprehensive. Popular India / UAE.<br><strong>Booksy:</strong> USA / Europe strong.<br><strong>MioSalon / Salonist:</strong> India-first SMB.<br><strong>Vagaro:</strong> USA SMB.<br><strong>Timely:</strong> Australia / NZ.</p>
                                    <h2>When Custom Makes Sense</h2>
                                    <p>Chains with 20+ outlets and unique staff commission models. Specialty service businesses (medi-spa, aesthetic clinics with prescription drugs / medical devices). Salon brands wanting fully-branded consumer app experience separate from Fresha / Booksy pattern.</p>
                                    <h2>Cost + Timeline</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Off-shelf SaaS:</strong> $30-200/staff/month + transaction fees.<br><strong>Custom MVP (14-22 weeks):</strong> ₹25-60 lakh / $30K-72K.<br><strong>Chain-scale custom (22-36 weeks):</strong> ₹75 lakh - 2 Cr / $90K-240K.<br><strong>Franchise / enterprise:</strong> ₹2-5 Cr / $240K-600K.</p>
                                    <h2>Staff Commission: The Real Complexity</h2>
                                    <p>Staff commission structures vary wildly: flat percentage, tiered by service, split with brand, senior stylist vs junior, product-vs-service commission, tip-pooling. Custom builds win here because off-shelf tools force you into their commission model.</p>

                                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: #fff;">
                                        <h3 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:15px;">Ready to Get Started?</h3>
