                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Fresha vs Zenoti?</h3>
                                        <p>Fresha for small salons + freemium model. Zenoti for chains / spa / medi-spa. Different price points, different UX philosophy.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does custom salon software cost?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: ₹25-60 lakh ($30K-72K). Chain-scale: ₹75 lakh - 2 Cr ($90K-240K). Enterprise franchise: ₹2-5 Cr ($240K-600K).</p>
                                        <h3>Should I build a consumer app for my salon chain?</h3>
                                        <p>For chains 20+ outlets with strong brand, yes — Fresha's brand takes over the consumer experience otherwise. Custom app protects your brand + customer relationship.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest salon software failure?</h3>
                                        <p>Under-supporting staff commission complexity. Staff notice immediately when commission is wrong; adoption fails.</p>
